            "notes": "Checks the health, running status and capacity usage of all storage pools on a Huawei OceanStor Dorado storage system via the REST API (/storagepool endpoint). Alerts when a pool reports a non-normal state, and when its used capacity reaches the warning or critical threshold. Supports reporting the I/O counters via --performance.",
